Hello;
Myself Pratik Gharat ,I’m here to share my experience about young eye clinic centre & therapy that i have taken to make my vision better than before. sooo…. last year in 2022 i got selected in merchant Navy …i have cleared my exams & interview process but unfortunately not able to clear my medical round because i have number in my eyes …so i was out in medical round . After that i came to dr.gharat at vasai for eye check up after the check up dr. told me that I’m digonse with amblyopia…so dr.gharat has given me a suggestion of young eye clinic (dr.larrisa mam ) which specifically deals with a person or child having amblyopiaic vision …..so I started my therapy at young eye clinic  at least for 2 months and after 2 months of therapy my vision has came back to normal vision which is 6/6 vision .. & now i will be able to do my lasik & can achieve my dream..Talking about the therapy it was fun doing it …..just a excercise of eye which will help to improve yours vision ..uh will see miracles changes in your vision after the therapy that i had experience throughout my therapy. Many people or some dr.says that amblyopia cannot be treated or cured after the age of 18 or below but believe me it’s a myth that it cannot be treated.I’m 18 yrs old and i have cured my amblyopiaic vision & now vision is 6/6 with the therapy…so i would suggest that if uh have amblyopia or any other vision problem please do visit young eye clinic , take an appointment,take prescription of larrisa mam …do the therapy & make yours vision better.
Thank you.
